{"id":"vod_hh_71037","vodId":"71037","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"赛文奥特曼 我是地球人","name_cn":"赛文奥特曼 我是地球人","date":"1999-01-01","year":"1999","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第16集完结","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/434f2774582010201d7784fa906e546a.jpg"},"summary":"在幾百萬年前，地球原本是外星人的故鄉，人類殘暴的祖先在地球進行殺戳把這地方鵲巢鳩佔。而世代以來，所有統治者還一直把紀錄了這個秘密的「亞米加檔案」禁敝起來，不肯承認過錯。事實上，外星人直對地球虎視眈眈，並非因為要侵略，而是想討回公道。這次，外星人決定實行最大的報復行動。即使地球高層最終決定向宇宙公開承認「亞米加檔案」的內容，但是也按制不住外星人為國復仇的決心。作為地球的好朋友，七星俠不忍袖手旁觀，但是從宇宙公義的角度看，他理應主持公道……七星俠將會如何抉擇？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-21 13:30:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":16,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAY2kPa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGV2m8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8Dxvgb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel9mora/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQ82ELe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YerlvxKb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKV2xYe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6AvJla/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/mepjq5Nb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/PdyvDNPe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZ9oQRd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej9k4ld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Yerlvx4b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nel9moga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVVkxve/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集完结","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2wom1d/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:46:07.865Z"}